ican Industry Classification System (NAICS) Code","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":6,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"The North American Industry Classification System code representing the primary industry associated with the transmission line owner or operator. This allows classification of infrastructure by economic sector.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"typeOrCategory\"}"},{"name":"NAICS_DESC","type":"esriFieldTypeString","alias":"North American Industry Classification System (NAICS) Description","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":44,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"A text description corresponding to the NAICS code assigned to the entity associated with the transmission line. This provides a human-readable explanation of the industry category.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"description\"}"},{"name":"SOURCE","type":"esriFieldTypeString","alias":"Data Source Reference","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":254,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"The source from which the transmission line information was obtained, such as surveys, datasets, or compiled records. This field provides transparency regarding data provenance.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"description\"}"},{"name":"SOURCEDATE","type":"esriFieldTypeDate","alias":"Data Source Publication Date","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":8,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"The date when the source data was originally published or last updated. This helps users evaluate the timeliness and relevance of the information.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"dateAndTime\"}","precision":1},{"name":"VAL_METHOD","type":"esriFieldTypeString","alias":"Validation Method","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":13,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"The method used to validate the transmission line data, such as field verification, aerial imagery, or modeling. This helps assess the confidence level of the dataset.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"typeOrCategory\"}"},{"name":"VAL_DATE","type":"esriFieldTypeDate","alias":"Validation Date","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":8,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"The date when the transmission line record was last validated or verified. This provides insight into data quality and recency of review.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"dateAndTime\"}","precision":1},{"name":"OWNER","type":"esriFieldTypeString","alias":"Transmission Line Ownership Entity","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":62,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"The name of the organization or company that owns or operates the transmission line. This field supports analysis of infrastructure ownership and utility networks.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"nameOrTitle\"}"},{"name":"VOLTAGE","type":"esriFieldTypeDouble","alias":"Voltage (Kilovolts)","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"The operating voltage of the transmission line expressed in kilovolts (kV). This is a critical attribute for understanding transmission capacity and electrical characteristics.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"measurement\"}"},{"name":"VOLT_CLASS","type":"esriFieldTypeString","alias":"Voltage Class","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":13,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"A categorical grouping of the transmission line based on its operating voltage range. This helps simplify analysis of grid capacity and infrastructure type.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"typeOrCategory\"}"},{"name":"INFERRED","type":"esriFieldTypeString","alias":"Attribute Inference Indicator","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":13,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"A flag indicating whether certain attributes of the transmission line were inferred rather than directly reported. This helps users assess data reliability and understand potential limitations in accuracy.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"binary\"}"},{"name":"SUB_1","type":"esriFieldTypeString","alias":"Origin Substation Name","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":44,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"The name of the substation where the transmission line begins. This helps define the starting point of the electrical transmission segment.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"nameOrTitle\"}"},{"name":"SUB_2","type":"esriFieldTypeString","alias":"Destination Substation Name","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":60,"nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"The name of the substation where the transmission line terminates. This field, together with the origin substation, defines the connectivity of the power grid.\",\"fieldValueType\":\"nameOrTitle\"}"},{"name":"Shape__Len","type":"esriFieldTypeDouble","alias":"Shape Length","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"Length of the transmission line\",\"fieldValueType\":\"measurement\"}"},{"name":"Shape__Length","type":"esriFieldTypeDouble","alias":"Shape Length","sqlType":"sqlTypeDouble","nullable":true,"editable":true,"isViewOverride":true,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":"{\"value\":\"The precise calculated length of the transmission line geometry within the GIS system. This measurement is used for accurate spatial analysis and enginee